%% Sequence: report a Maintenance Request, routing with a time limit, escalation
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor St as Student
  participant MC as MaintenanceController
  participant MS as MaintenanceService
  participant MR as MaintenanceRouting (REQ)
  participant RS as RoutingService
  participant P as MaintenanceRequests (MNT port)
  participant EJ as EscalationJob (15 min)
  participant ES as EscalationService
  actor Sf as Staff
  actor Mg as Manager
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  St->>MC: POST /maintenance-requests (form + photos, furniture item)
  MC->>MS: report(command)
  MS->>DB: insert mnt_request (Submitted) + photos
  MS-->>MR: MaintenanceReported
  MR->>RS: route(request)
  RS-->>MR: assignee (rule by type and condition)
  MR->>P: assign(id, staff), setSlaDue(id, urgent or normal timer)
  P->>DB: Assigned, sla_due_at
  MR-->>Sf: notification (new request)
  Sf->>MC: PATCH /maintenance-requests/{id} {status In progress / Resolved}
  EJ->>ES: scan()
  ES->>DB: requests past sla_due_at or unassigned too long → req_escalation (Open)
  Mg->>ES: POST /escalations/{id}/actions {reassign / note}
  St->>MC: POST /maintenance-requests/{id}/confirm {fixed}
  MC->>DB: Closed (or reopened)
